{"type":"message","id":"66db6139","parentId":"03750519","timestamp":"2026-02-27T08:56:13.042Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's no team-task skill. Let me try a different approach - I'll use exec to spawn subagents using the openclaw sessions system. But first, let me check if there's a sessions tool or if I should use a different mechanism.\n\nActually, looking at the context, I'm a subagent myself (depth 1/1). The task mentions using search-agent, design-agent, etc., but I may need to do this work myself or use exec to spawn processes.\n\nLet me proceed by doing the research myself using web_search, then move to design. This is more efficient than trying to coordinate subagents which may not be available.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll proceed with the research myself using web_search tools, then move to design. Let me start with ANKI research:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3f6e2d6db3ab4859b6784045","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"ANKI daily new card limit settings deck options","count":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_23625c51eca94cdf967525d3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"ANKI review limit maximum reviews per day algorithm","count":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":22007,"output":390,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22397,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772182568472}}
