rides | ✅ |\n| Template editor preview (API) | ✅ |\n| 5+ predefined templates | ✅ (6) |\n| All functionality tested | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n### 📁 Deliverables\n\n**Location**: `/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/`\n\n- `src/daily-limits.js` - Daily limits module\n- `src/template-manager.js` - Template manager\n- `src/api-phase4.js` - API endpoints\n- `src/migrate-phase4.js` - Migration script\n- `design/phase4_design.md` - Design document\n- `research/anki_daily_limits.md` - ANKI research\n- `PHASE4_COMPLETE.md` - Completion summary\n- `test/phase4.test.js` - Test suite\n\n**Report**: `/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent/memory/fsrs-phase4-report.md`\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Ready for Next Phase\n\n**Backend**: ✅ Complete and production-ready  \n**Frontend UI**: Needs implementation (settings page, template editor, progress widget)\n\nThe server automatically runs migrations on startup. All APIs are functional and tested."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":87269,"output":728,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87997,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772183324260}}
